=== RENDER SMOKE, AND WHAT IT IS NOT =================================
Run in the chat sandbox against site/index.html served over http, in
chromium 1194 - NOT the build this repository pins. That makes it good
evidence for 'does it draw and does anything throw' and NO evidence at
all for a figure: an instrument has to be the right one before its
verdict means anything, and measure-page belongs on the devbox.
Offline, so status/*.json, the timeline objects and api.github.com are
404 or CORS - which is why the caption below says nothing is measured.

